## @file
#  Memory-mapped FVB for the UEFI variable store, persisted to the microSD
#  card (the NV store is part of the FD inside the FIT image).
#  Based on Platform/RaspberryPi/Drivers/VarBlockServiceDxe.
#
#  Copyright (c) 2018, Andrei Warkentin <andrey.warkentin@gmail.com>
#  Copyright (c) 2006-2013, Intel Corporation. All rights reserved.
